"CH1_INNER_PRESSURE": "Footsteps draw closer. Decide whether to hide or stay and speak.",
"CH1_INNER_UNKNOWN": "That object cannot be identified.",
"CH1_INNER_DESK": "A damaged journal and three blotting sheets. Aligning the corner grooves and impressions might make them legible.",
"CH1_INNER_DESK_VISIT": "A damaged journal and three blotting sheets. Aligning the corner grooves and impressions might make them legible.\nFootsteps stop outside the door. The latch turns.",
"CH1_INNER_INDEX": "The rustle of index cards carries sharply toward the door.",
"CH1_INNER_INDEX_VISIT": "The rustle of index cards carries sharply toward the door.\nFootsteps stop outside the door. The latch turns.",
"CH1_INNER_DRAWER": "The drawer catches. The wood gives a brief creak.",
"CH1_INNER_DRAWER_VISIT": "The drawer catches. The wood gives a brief creak.\nFootsteps stop outside the door. The latch turns.",
"CH1_INNER_ALCOVE": "The maintenance alcove is hollow inside. There is room to hide.",
"CH1_INNER_ALCOVE_VISIT": "The maintenance alcove is hollow inside. There is room to hide.\nFootsteps stop outside the door. The latch turns.",
"CH1_INNER_GAP": "One empty space after the full stop, then a dot of ink. A sound that remains after the end.",
"CH1_INNER_GAP_VISIT": "One empty space after the full stop, then a dot of ink. A sound that remains after the end.\nFootsteps stop outside the door. The latch turns.",
"CH1_INNER_LINK": "A latch on the inside of the portrait panel. I need to check the restored journal and the route before opening it.",
"CH1_INNER_LINK_VISIT": "A latch on the inside of the portrait panel. I need to check the restored journal and the route before opening it.\nFootsteps stop outside the door. The latch turns.",
"CH1_INNER_LINK_OPEN": "I opened the inner latch. Next morning, remembering this mechanism will let me open the connecting door quickly.",
"CH1_INNER_LINK_OPEN_VISIT": "I opened the inner latch. Next morning, remembering this mechanism will let me open the connecting door quickly.\nFootsteps stop outside the door. The latch turns.",
