"CH1_J1_FRAGMENT_0": "If you remember yesterday,\ndo not begin by trusting the time shown on a face.",
"CH1_J1_FRAGMENT_1": "One counts the day.\nOne stands still, passing a tremor to the next room.\nOne has lost its voice, yet makes the final door resound.",
"CH1_J1_FRAGMENT_2": "It is not the time that is wrong.\nIt is the sound one space beyond what you thought was the end. ·",
"CH1_J1_RESTORED": "If you remember yesterday,\ndo not begin by trusting the time shown on a face.\n\nOne counts the day.\nOne stands still, passing a tremor to the next room.\nOne has lost its voice, yet makes the final door resound.\n\nIt is not the time that is wrong.\nIt is the sound one space beyond what you thought was the end. ·",
