"CH1_B2_HIDDEN_BOARD": "Inside the maintenance alcove\nEdgar is checking the desk. Before long, his footsteps recede.",
"CH1_B2_ENTRY": "The footsteps outside the door stop. The latch turns.",
"CH1_B2_HIDE": "Hide in the maintenance alcove",
"CH1_B2_TALK": "Stay and speak to Edgar",
"CH1_B2_HIDDEN": "I steady my breathing in the alcove. Edgar enters and checks the desk and the locking lines.",
"CH1_B2_NORMAL": "Is there a book you wish to read? Please return it to its place when you have finished.",
"CH1_B2_ALERT": "Is there a book you wish to read? Please return it to its place when you have finished.\nIf your arrival at this hour is a coincidence, might the same coincidence occur again?",
"CH1_B2_LEFT": "The footsteps recede again. Edgar has left and closed the door. The blotting paper and journal are untouched.",
"CH1_B2_ABSENT": "Edgar is not in this room right now.",
"CH1_B2_NEED_ALCOVE": "First locate the maintenance alcove where you can hide.",
