"CH1_B1_MORNING": "From morning until afternoon tea",
"CH1_B1_TEA": "After tea is cleared away, before the evening bell",
"CH1_B1_BELL": "After the evening bell",
"CH1_B1_NEED_CONFIRM": "Confirm that the notebook persists, then investigate in the servants' common room.",
"CH1_B1_NEED_DOCS": "You need at least two core documents to cross-check the time references.",
"CH1_B1_WRONG": "The records place someone supervising or signing back into the inner archive then. Compare the interval between tea clearance and the evening bell.",
"CH1_B1_SOLVED": "The inner archive is empty after afternoon tea is cleared away and before the evening bell rings.",
"CH1_B1_TEXT_EDGAR": "Work ledger. Supervise the outer library after morning greetings. Confirm afternoon tea clearance. Inspect the west great clock. Return to the inner archive after the evening bell.\nCorrection: amended to 'from immediately after tea clearance until just before the evening bell.'",
"CH1_B1_TEXT_LUCA": "After afternoon tea clearance: one pot of warm water, two dry cloths, one cup with a small handle. Deliver to the west great clock room.\nObtain a signature at the clock inspection bench. Return before the cup cools.",
"CH1_B1_TEXT_MARA1": "Library corridor: dust in the morning; finish the floor before afternoon tea clearance. Return tools after tea clearance. No re-entry before the evening bell.\nPut way too much oil on the ladder wheels. Rolled so well I had to chase it down.",
"CH1_B1_TEXT_MARA2": "Portrait record checkout: completed just after afternoon tea. Five target indices. Due back after the evening bell.\nIt's not a duplicate! They're both me!",
